# Build context of apps/docs/Dockerfile (and Railway, railway.json): the repository root. The image installs and
# builds everything itself, so nothing built or installed on the host may leak in. A stale *.tsbuildinfo without its
# dist/ in particular would make `tsc -b` skip packages it must build.
.git
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.next
**/.next-*
**/.source
**/.turbo
**/.cache
artifacts
coverage
work
.claude
.env
.env.*
.npmrc
.admin-secret
daemon/bin
daemon/dist
apps/console/.console-data
bench/**/results
